      "type": "text",
      "text": "{\n  \"file\": {\n    \"id\": \"01M4DWHDEJ6WVWRH6FVX7E3017\",\n    \"name\": \"Pirate Design System\"\n  },\n  \"contentHash\": {\n    \"tokens\": \"6d78f570\"\n  }\n}"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "(\n    <div style={{ backgroundColor: 'var(--color-background)', boxSizing: 'border-box', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', fontSize: '12px', fontSynthesis: 'none', gap: '40px', height: 'fit-content', lineHeight: '16px', MozOsxFontSmoothing: 'grayscale', overflow: 'clip', overflowWrap: 'anywhere', padding: '48px', WebkitFontSmoothing: 'antialiased', width: '1280px' }}>\n      <div style={{ boxSizing: 'border-box', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: '8px' }}>\n        <div style={{ boxSizing: 'border-box', color: 'var(--color-foreground)', fontFamily: '\"Inter\", system-ui, sans-serif', fontSize: '30px', fontWeight: 600, letterSpacing: '-0.025em', lineHeight: '36px' }}>\n          RewardPill\n        </div>\n        <div style={{ boxSizing: 'border-box', color: 'var(--color-muted-foreground)', fontFamily: '\"Inter\", system-ui, sans-serif', fontSize: '16px', lineHeight: '24px', whiteSpace: 'pre-wrap', width: '900px' }}>\n          Under review. The third pill on a song post, after votes and comments. It does one thing: opens that song's rewards sheet (Parts/Rewards/SongEarnSheet), which is where Study, Karaoke and Dance start. It is the only way into them from a post (workspace_owner, 2026-10-11).<br />The number is how many activities the song offers. It is not money, not a count of rewards, and never says the viewer has earned anything. Earning is shown only on the result screens (Parts/Rewards/ActivityResult) and in the Wallet.<br />A post with no song has no pill; it is left out, not greyed.<br />Same height, radius and outline as VotePill and CommentPill (Patterns/Engagement).<br />Loading and unavailable looks are not drawn. The app has no reward pill on posts yet, so there is nothing built to support either; they are to design when the pill is built, not assumed here.<br />Instances checked: the song post on the profile page, phone and desktop (Screens/Profiles/Profile); the song and video cards on Parts/Posts/PostCard, whose caption now gives the same meaning for the number; the community feed behind the join and sign-in sheets. All have the same look. Not rechecked: the post page's song post.\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style={{ alignItems: 'start', boxSizing: 'border-box', display: 'flex', gap: '48px' }}>\n        <div style={{ boxSizing: 'border-box', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: '16px' }}>\n          <div style={{ boxSizing: 'border-box', color: 'var(--color-muted-foreground)', fontFamily: '\"Inter\", system-ui, sans-serif', fontSize: '16px', fontWeight: 500, letterSpacing: '0.03em', lineHeight: '20px', textTransform: 'uppercase' }}>\n            Default\n          </div>\n          <div style={{ alignItems: 'center', backgroundColor: 'var(--color-background)', borderColor: 'var(--color-border-soft)', borderRadius: 'calc(infinity * 1px)', borderStyle: 'solid', borderWidth: '1px', boxSizing: 'border-box', display: 'flex', flexShrink: '0', gap: '8px', height: '44px', paddingInline: '14px' }}>\n            <svg width=\"23\" height=\"23\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style={{ display: 'inline-block', flexShrink: '0' }}>\n              <path d=\"M216,72H180.92c.39-.33.79-.65,1.17-1A29.53,29.53,0,0,0,192,49.57,32.62,32.62,0,0,0,158.44,16,29.53,29.53,0,0,0,137,25.91a54.94,54.94,0,0,0-9,14.48,54.94,54.94,0,0,0-9-14.48A29.53,29.53,0,0,0,97.56,16,32.62,32.62,0,0,0,64,49.57,29.53,29.53,0,0,0,73.91,71c.38.33.78.65,1.17,1H40A16,16,0,0,0,24,88v32a16,16,0,0,0,16,16v64a16,16,0,0,0,16,16H200a16,16,0,0,0,16-16V136a16,16,0,0,0,16-16V88A16,16,0,0,0,216,72ZM149,36.51a13.69,13.69,0,0,1,10-4.5h.49A16.62,16.62,0,0,1,176,49.08a13.69,13.69,0,0,1-4.5,10c-9.49,8.4-25.24,11.36-35,12.4C137.7,60.89,141,45.5,149,36.51Zm-64.09.36A16.63,16.63,0,0,1,96.59,32h.49a13.69,13.69,0,0,1,10,4.5c8.39,9.48,11.35,25.2,12.39,34.92-9.72-1-25.44-4-34.92-12.39a13.69,13.69,0,0,1-4.5-10A16.6,16.6,0,0,1,84.87,36.87ZM40,88h80v32H40Zm16,48h64v64H56Zm144,64H136V136h64Zm16-8